message: "If you use this archive in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Slip-Stick Dynamics in Butyl Pressure-Sensitive Adhesive-Silicone Release Liner Systems: Supplementary Data and Analysis Code"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-05-28
authors:
  - family-names: "Czakaj"
    given-names: "Jakub"
    affiliation: "Almara sp. z o.o. sp.k."
abstract: >-
  Supplementary data and analysis code for a manuscript on slip-stick dynamics
  in butyl pressure-sensitive adhesive and silicone release-liner systems. The
  archive contains FTM 10-type release-test datasets, the canonical generator
  used for release-force tables and figures, generated publication outputs, and
  supplementary material files.
keywords:
  - slip-stick
  - tensile testing
  - signal processing
  - materials science
  - friction
  - adhesion
  - FTM 10
  - Python
license: MIT
